Your dirges carry the pain within you, which threatens to swallow those who come too close.  Anyone who hits you in melee suffers [65, 88, 105, 120, 133 (TL1-5; MP 100; LVL 50)] mind damage.

You, on the other hand, are steadied by the song.  Your dirges increase your resistance to stun and knockback by [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5)].

The damage will increase with your Mindpower and your level.
